      en: ["Originally constructed in 875 AD by King Mutpi Raja.", "Stands 150 feet tall, dominating the Mawlamyine skyline.", "Famously mentioned in Rudyard Kipling's poem 'Mandalay'.", "Offers a 360-degree view of the Salween River and city.", "Features a large bell with inscriptions in three languages.", "A key historical and religious site for the Mon people."],
      es: ["La pagoda se encuentra a 150 metros sobre el nivel del mar.", "El ascenso consta de 500 escalones.", "La estatua de Buda mide 9 metros de altura.", "La pagoda se terminó en 2005.", "Los costes de construcción ascendieron a 1,5 millones de dólares.", "Anualmente, 100.000 peregrinos visitan la pagoda."],
