      en: ["Comprises eight different rock towers topped with stupas.", "The name Taung Kwe means 'Cleft Mountain' in Burmese.", "Offers 360-degree views of Loikaw and Kayah State.", "Built on natural limestone outcrops rising from the plain.", "Features colorful nocturnal lighting for a dramatic effect.", "Includes a modern elevator for easier visitor access."],
